{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wilderness Edge \u2013 Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the <strong>Wilderness Edge</strong> demo! This limited version gives you an early hands-on look at the survival adventure we\u2019re building at Envying Centaur Gaming. While this isn\u2019t the full game, there\u2019s plenty to  test out! (This demo is a work-in-progress, so expect bugs, missing features, and placeholder content.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What\u2019s in the Demo:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714\ufe0f Crafting and Hotbar System<br>\u2714\ufe0f Choppable Trees and Mineable Rocks<br>\u2714\ufe0f Interactive Foliage<br>\u2714\ufe0f Building System<br>\u2714\ufe0f Swimming and Farming<br>\u2714\ufe0f Basic Animal AI<br>\u2714\ufe0f Ragdoll Physics<br>\u2714\ufe0f Advanced Combat and Respawn Systems<br>\u2714\ufe0f Advanced Outliner and Interaction<br>\u2714\ufe0f UI + Gamepad Support</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Still in Progress (Not Available in Demo):</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Fishing System</strong><br>\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Global Save System</strong><br>\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Multiplayer Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is a work-in-progress, so expect bugs, missing features, and placeholder content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019d love your feedback, so jump in, test it out, and let us know what you think as we shape the future of <i>Wilderness Edge</i>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3704850?t=1747596178","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704850/a1388e3a622a712e2fea6a493e932e166b8df942/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747596178","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704850/f0c3bac08f375734a7accdecf13d6be1f2062f16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747596178","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps